2. The Board of Directors Charter which has been updated based on a Letter in 2024;
3. Charter of the Board of Commissioners which was updated in 2024;
4. Audit Committee Charter which was updated in 2024;
5. Nomination and Remuneration Committee Charter which was updated in 2024;
